# Same 4 bytes NervesSheng.Hardware.board_id/0 reads - no uboot_env on this
# device, and /proc/cpuinfo has no usable serial on this SoC, so the
# generic examples don't apply. binfile reads arbitrary bytes from any
# file, so point it straight at the real hardware property.
-b binfile -f /proc/device-tree/qcom,board-id -l 4
